{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "efcf6b927ffb12d6b8afa46520eacb0a16b22ec75eed48d44c177dfbf26c6745", "ja": "（『BATTLE OF THEATER』のプロモーションで\nTV局に来ている。静香が生放送で告知をする予定だ）", "zh": "（为了宣传《BATTLE OF THEATER》，来到电视台。静香预定在现场直播中进行宣传）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "852795d10c30f0a5e678ec5727279876d4bae305316a551be9d4e9fa7df49cef", "ja": "スゥー、ハァァァ……押忍ッ！", "zh": "吸——呼——喝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "0b0c35ece3c5c9adacd57435fe10d1936066451dd32111cad5d241a23e4800fa", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nお疲れ様です。……どうかしましたか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n辛苦了。……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a9e7d863d6773438d6eb94ef0473a85ec69dfaf87c41e1a27e73b35f8824a074", "ja": "もうすぐ出番だから、呼びにきたんだけど……\n今のは、なんだったんだ？", "zh": "马上就该轮到你出场了，我来叫你过去……\n刚才那是在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "d2472df6a992f99a3622bd18fd6e2e51093caadb9566f76cbeb6964082102f9d", "ja": "今の？　ああ、押忍ってやつですか？\n空手の掛け声ですよ。", "zh": "刚才那个？啊，是“押忍”吧？\n是空手道的喝声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "4a0fc23b4130e7a840d44379418d63dcd7e364c3f4c8d37ece2873cf37dd7c87", "ja": "真さんが教えてくれたんです。\n緊張した時にやってみなよ、って。", "zh": "是真教我的。\n她说紧张的时候就试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1007_p", "source_sha256": "044e6fc62eed419d45927d7da2d65c2cb2598cb17783bd80aca8abce6a737610", "ja": "なるほど、真が……。\nという事は、静香、緊張してるのか？", "zh": "原来如此，真教你的……也就是说，静香，你紧张了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "54c523e566371f3c6f2a675fb724965157d4a98937bf0792f53515c50fb900c5", "ja": "ま、まあ、多少は……。\n新しい企画の宣伝なんて、責任重大ですし。", "zh": "嗯、多少还是有点……  \n毕竟要宣传新的企划，责任重大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "16258427b1a2cc1c931c0770ed51d53815b9ec395889c536a462b31be4716bae", "ja": "でも、まかせてください。これくらいできなくちゃ、\n未来や翼、劇場のみんなに勝つなんて、無理ですから。", "zh": "不过，请交给我吧。连这点事都做不到的话，想要胜过未来、翼以及剧场的大家，可是不可能的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a8dc0c3261d4ab9b8084ff0e4b11c355cc25c3a401213a38acbe1f30050e86ba", "ja": "なるほど。緊張というより、\n気合いを入れるために……だな。", "zh": "原来如此。与其说是紧张，不如说是为了鼓足干劲……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "f9c0f41f370c559afa073ad4cd9cd6c137d4b73453577c0a6702daafa5812087", "ja": "はい。みんなに勝つために……\n何より、弱気な自分に勝つために、かな？", "zh": "是的。为了战胜大家……\n不，更重要的是，为了战胜那个软弱的自己吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "f6ed32c9e7b7a8685f150a8f03cc81e947f2b66ea24c3e200d353844d961852d", "ja": "とにかく、今日の宣伝は、気合いで\n乗り切ろうと思います！　スゥー、ハァー……。", "zh": "总之，今天的宣传活动，我打算靠干劲撑过去！吸——呼——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0ea0fd48179b8cfa001b45d9d3455e8021b3d4b1b9a9c155eb4604d3f1cf82c4", "ja": "そうか。まあ、静香なら大丈夫だと思うよ。\nそんなに気負わなくても。", "zh": "这样啊。不过，我觉得静香肯定没问题的。\n不用那么紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "4ab733804e3fbe38811e39ea6f2061c09f37f7e3f2d81dddfd759e5c5411cd2c", "ja": "またそんな、適当なことを……。\n根拠のない励ましは、かえって不安になるんですよ！", "zh": "你又说这种不负责任的话……\n没有根据的鼓励，反而更让人不安啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1015_p", "source_sha256": "19ae2bdb006a8dfefbf1f569c1fd036c6f62e2ad4be1172f0dac2b87a1f614d0", "ja": "根拠ならある。\n静香の事なら、ずっと見てきたからな！", "zh": "要说依据，我当然有。\n关于静香的事，我可是一直都看在眼里的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "1c2b7fccd1420271b99df0aa5f4cb5ddfd489ae660483f7baf453dccf19c2335", "ja": "それ、根拠なんですか？　もう……。", "zh": "那算是根据吗？真是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e2ad118b269affd96887b5d31c145a304067bb6514dbc2eff2b1210de224c636", "ja": "それにほら、掛け声のお陰かな？　もう緊張して\nなさそうだし。自然体でいけば、きっと大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "而且你看，说不定是因为大家的口号？已经看起来不怎么紧张了。保持自然状态的话，一定没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0563_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "97e9c55102ff098b3e6bfc99c67438d2f370d1aa21387efa6c36599cbf1c0172", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね。{$P$}、\nそれじゃ、行ってきます！", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。{$P$}，那我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
